¶ Just wanted to hear ¶

236
00:35:19,100 --> 00:35:24,600
¶ Your cute voice ¶

237
00:35:24,700 --> 00:35:29,200
¶ To know you are near" ¶

238
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:03,400
¶ And he calls me "kitten" ¶

239
00:36:03,500 --> 00:36:06,000
¶ Kitten ¶

